      "text": "If a thief be found breaking up, Ex. 22:2. then that thief shall die, Deut. 24:7. When thou sawest a thief, Ps. 50:18. Men do not despise a thief … when he is hungry, Prov. 6:30. As the thief is ashamed when he is found, Jer. 2:26. if thieves by night, they will destroy till they have enough, Jer. 49:9 (Obad. 1:5).",
