    {
      "text": "where thieves break through and steal, Matt. 6:19 (3 Ne. 13:19; 27:32). made it a den of thieves, Matt. 21:13 (Mark 11:17; Luke 19:46). in what watch the thief would come, Matt. 24:43 (Luke 12:39; JS—M 1:47). Are ye come out as against a thief, Matt. 26:55 (Mark 14:48; Luke 22:52). two thieves crucified with him, Matt. 27:38 (Mark 15:27). certain man … fell among thieves, Luke 10:30. treasure in the heavens … where no thief approacheth, Luke 12:33. climbeth up some other way, the same is a thief, John 10:1. This he said … because he was a thief, John 12:6. day of the Lord so cometh as a thief in the night, 1 Thes. 5:2 (2 Pet. 3:10). let none … suffer as a murderer, or as a thief, 1 Pet. 4:15. I will come on thee as a thief, Rev. 3:3 (16:15; D&C 45:19; 106:4).",
